    <briefdescription>
<para>Log perf jitdump events for each object (see <ulink url="https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux.git/tree/tools/perf/Documentation/jitdump-specification.txt">https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/torvalds/linux.git/tree/tools/perf/Documentation/jitdump-specification.txt</ulink>). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Currently has support for dumping code load records and unwind info records. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
